{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"5006004010010","name":"雛菜","text":"あは～……\r\n人いっぱい～……","trans":"啊哈～……\n好多人～……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004010030","name":"小糸","text":"も、もうすぐ始まるよ\r\n透ちゃん、雛菜ちゃん……！","trans":"马、马上就要开始了\n透，雏菜……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004010040","name":"小糸","text":"じゅ、準備できてる……！？\r\nだ、大丈夫……！？","trans":"准、准备好了……！？\n没、没事吧……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004010060","name":"円香","text":"小糸が一番やばそうだけど","trans":"小糸看起来最危险啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004010140","name":"小糸","text":"わ、わたしは……\r\nだ、大丈夫…………！","trans":"我、我……\n没、没事的…………！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004010160","name":"雛菜","text":"ね、始まるまであと何分くらいある～？","trans":"呐，到开始还有几分钟～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004010170","name":"透","text":"え\r\n何分だろ","trans":"诶\n几分钟呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004010180","name":"小糸","text":"…………\r\n大丈夫、だよね……？","trans":"…………\n没事的吧……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}